WEBVTT

00:00:14.620 --> 00:00:16.290
Let me go!

00:00:16.290 --> 00:00:17.700
Shut up!

00:00:20.910 --> 00:00:22.080
Val!

00:00:23.950 --> 00:00:25.950
Why can't I hit him?!

00:00:29.200 --> 00:00:32.200
I do not wish to use violence.

00:00:32.200 --> 00:00:35.950
Help! Val! Val! Val!

00:00:35.950 --> 00:00:37.330
Shut up!

00:00:37.330 --> 00:00:38.700
Harazy!

00:00:44.950 --> 00:00:46.200
What the hell?

00:00:48.330 --> 00:00:49.790
Huh?

00:02:44.120 --> 00:02:46.700
Another grisly corpse.

00:02:46.700 --> 00:02:49.790
You think the humanoid monsters
are behind this, too?

00:02:49.790 --> 00:02:51.910
Humanoid monsters...

00:02:54.080 --> 00:02:57.290
Officers, I saw it all.

00:03:07.370 --> 00:03:09.410
A-Annabella...

00:03:09.410 --> 00:03:10.450
Huh?

00:03:10.450 --> 00:03:13.660
N-No. I-It's nothing.

00:03:15.370 --> 00:03:18.540
<i>Transcendent Illusion From Enceladus</i> .

00:03:18.540 --> 00:03:19.580
That's right!

00:03:19.580 --> 00:03:22.000
The illusions done in the Outside arena!

00:03:22.000 --> 00:03:23.450
They are really amazing.

00:03:23.450 --> 00:03:25.200
They surpass the human limits.

00:03:25.200 --> 00:03:27.870
And the members all claim they're aliens.

00:03:27.870 --> 00:03:30.040
I think they really are aliens!

00:03:30.040 --> 00:03:33.580
I see. They're not human, huh?

00:03:33.580 --> 00:03:36.370
So, what? Are you asking me to go?

00:03:36.370 --> 00:03:38.410
Well, I don't really...

00:03:38.410 --> 00:03:39.580
Sure.

00:03:39.580 --> 00:03:40.660
I won't force you...

00:03:40.660 --> 00:03:42.160
Wait, huh?

00:03:42.160 --> 00:03:44.790
Whaaat?!

00:03:49.870 --> 00:03:51.700
Bwoom!

00:03:54.000 --> 00:03:55.580
Val!

00:03:55.580 --> 00:03:57.540
What's with her?

00:03:57.540 --> 00:03:59.700
It's almost our turn.

00:03:59.700 --> 00:04:01.290
Give me candy!

00:04:01.290 --> 00:04:03.200
After the show.

00:04:03.200 --> 00:04:04.910
Aww.

00:04:04.910 --> 00:04:06.870
It's Gravity Man and Harazy.

00:04:06.870 --> 00:04:07.830
I know!

00:04:07.830 --> 00:04:09.830
Harazy is so cute!

00:04:15.290 --> 00:04:17.500
About the corpse the other day.

00:04:17.500 --> 00:04:18.830
We are still unsure.

00:04:18.830 --> 00:04:21.750
Did the humanoid monster do that, too?

00:04:24.120 --> 00:04:27.250
So, was there any information from above?

00:04:29.250 --> 00:04:30.660
Val Titan.

00:04:30.660 --> 00:04:33.120
He's an astronaut from a certain country.

00:04:33.120 --> 00:04:34.950
What country is that?

00:04:34.950 --> 00:04:37.160
An unnecessary question.

00:04:37.160 --> 00:04:40.370
He was rescued from the lunar surface
after getting a fatal injury.

00:04:40.370 --> 00:04:43.000
He was institutionalized
at an army medical facility,

00:04:43.000 --> 00:04:45.910
but escaped two years ago
to another country...

00:04:45.910 --> 00:04:50.540
He obtained a special ability
after his accident.

00:04:50.540 --> 00:04:52.540
So, he's a humanoid monster.

00:04:52.540 --> 00:04:55.120
It is too early to tell.

00:04:55.120 --> 00:04:57.580
Are you ordering us to search for him?

00:04:57.580 --> 00:05:00.330
This man is currently in Libra City.

00:05:00.330 --> 00:05:02.750
He's the culprit.

00:05:02.750 --> 00:05:07.080
I'm already busy hunting Alpha,
so this request is quite troublesome.

00:05:07.080 --> 00:05:09.910
We have been ordered
to find him and hand him over.

00:05:09.910 --> 00:05:13.040
But if he is the culprit to these murders,

00:05:13.040 --> 00:05:16.160
our investigation should take priority.

00:05:16.160 --> 00:05:20.160
You should get a better grasp of politics.

00:05:21.910 --> 00:05:23.540
Where are you going?

00:05:23.540 --> 00:05:27.410
There was a witness who saw Gravity Man.

00:05:27.410 --> 00:05:29.290
I will go question him.

00:05:29.290 --> 00:05:32.330
Gravity man? Is he a humanoid monster?

00:05:32.330 --> 00:05:34.160
He is a star illusionist.

00:05:34.160 --> 00:05:35.950
Illusionist?

00:05:56.660 --> 00:05:58.410
Want to eat this?

00:05:58.410 --> 00:06:00.540
Upper's Sweet Ultimate Bon Bons.

00:06:00.540 --> 00:06:02.200
I waited in line for three hours.

00:06:02.200 --> 00:06:03.830
Vanilla. Mint. Bergamot.

00:06:03.830 --> 00:06:06.500
The blend of aromas is so enticing.

00:06:07.950 --> 00:06:09.370
Hmm.

00:06:09.370 --> 00:06:11.250
W-Well?

00:06:13.000 --> 00:06:15.370
It's good?

00:06:15.370 --> 00:06:17.000
Thank goodness.

00:06:18.700 --> 00:06:20.540
It's starting!

00:06:20.540 --> 00:06:23.290
We are <i>From Enceladus</i> .

00:06:23.290 --> 00:06:27.830
Enjoy the next two hours
and ten minutes of illusions!

00:06:53.250 --> 00:06:54.660
It's Gravity Man!

00:06:54.660 --> 00:06:56.290
He's the biggest pull to the show.

00:06:56.290 --> 00:06:59.330
They say he actually has superpowers.

00:07:00.410 --> 00:07:02.540
Just as his name implies,

00:07:02.540 --> 00:07:05.660
Gravity Man can control gravity at will.

00:07:08.410 --> 00:07:10.370
He can make heavy things light

00:07:10.370 --> 00:07:12.700
and light things heavy.

00:07:12.700 --> 00:07:14.580
Plop goes the rock!

00:07:19.040 --> 00:07:21.290
Umph. Umph.

00:07:24.910 --> 00:07:28.450
The rock grows lighter and lighter.

00:07:28.450 --> 00:07:30.620
Oh? So light!

00:07:32.160 --> 00:07:34.000
Time to juggle, Harazy!

00:07:34.000 --> 00:07:39.580
Alley-oop! Hup! Hup! Hup!

00:07:39.580 --> 00:07:42.250
Higher and higher!

00:07:43.500 --> 00:07:45.450
Higher!

00:07:48.410 --> 00:07:50.580
And the finale!

00:08:11.450 --> 00:08:12.910
Val's past?

00:08:12.910 --> 00:08:14.160
No idea.

00:08:14.160 --> 00:08:17.080
We ask for talent and nothing else.

00:08:17.080 --> 00:08:20.330
Well, it's true it seemed
he was in quite a pinch.

00:08:20.330 --> 00:08:22.950
Is this the face of Gravity Man?

00:08:22.950 --> 00:08:25.620
I've never seen his face before.

00:08:25.620 --> 00:08:29.410
Is his partner his blood-related daughter?

00:08:29.410 --> 00:08:31.160
Like I said, no idea.

00:08:31.160 --> 00:08:33.620
But they are really close.

00:08:33.620 --> 00:08:36.120
It warms your heart to watch them.

00:08:40.160 --> 00:08:42.540
Hey, hey. Val. Gimme candy.

00:08:42.540 --> 00:08:44.660
Harazy is all tuckered out.

00:08:44.660 --> 00:08:46.870
I see. Once we get home.

00:08:46.870 --> 00:08:49.330
Then, let's hurry home!

00:08:52.080 --> 00:08:56.370
It makes you really want to believe
that Gravity Man's power is real.

00:08:56.370 --> 00:08:58.830
Even if it's a trick, it's done so well.

00:08:58.830 --> 00:09:00.950
I mean, how would you be able
to do something like that?

00:09:00.950 --> 00:09:04.910
Well, I'm sure I'd be able
to figure it out. I mean...

00:09:04.910 --> 00:09:07.080
That girl...

00:09:07.080 --> 00:09:09.830
Good evening. You were amazing earlier.

00:09:09.830 --> 00:09:12.410
Thank you!

00:09:12.410 --> 00:09:14.330
Would you like some?

00:09:14.330 --> 00:09:16.450
I love Ultimate Bon Bons!

00:09:16.450 --> 00:09:18.370
Sure. It's yours.

00:09:18.370 --> 00:09:19.830
Thank you.

00:09:19.830 --> 00:09:22.160
My name is Harazy.

00:09:22.160 --> 00:09:24.950
I know. My name is Annabella.

00:09:24.950 --> 00:09:26.910
Call me Annie.

00:09:26.910 --> 00:09:28.620
Annie, you smell nice.

00:09:28.620 --> 00:09:31.410
Your hair is pretty and you're cute!

00:09:31.410 --> 00:09:32.950
Thank you.

00:09:35.370 --> 00:09:37.290
Delicious!

00:09:37.290 --> 00:09:39.620
Found you.

00:09:39.620 --> 00:09:45.330
To think you'd come on your own.
Like moths to a flame... a flame?

00:09:45.330 --> 00:09:48.040
Wh-Wh-Wha--?! What is this guy?!

00:09:48.040 --> 00:09:49.250
Step back.

00:09:59.540 --> 00:10:02.080
Did you see my power?

00:10:02.080 --> 00:10:05.500
It'll be easy to crush you.

00:10:05.500 --> 00:10:08.870
Harazy, I've come to pick you up.

00:10:08.870 --> 00:10:10.870
Stay away from her.

00:10:10.870 --> 00:10:13.950
Don't get involved.

00:10:13.950 --> 00:10:16.660
Now, be a good girl.

00:10:18.080 --> 00:10:19.870
Don't bother us.

00:10:19.870 --> 00:10:22.290
I do not wish to use violence.

00:10:22.290 --> 00:10:24.580
Don't be so cocky!

00:10:26.370 --> 00:10:28.080
Stop...

00:10:30.500 --> 00:10:33.000
Don't be mean to Val!

00:10:33.000 --> 00:10:35.120
So easy.

00:10:38.580 --> 00:10:39.450
No!

00:10:39.450 --> 00:10:40.870
Stop!

00:10:46.750 --> 00:10:47.910
Val!

00:10:47.910 --> 00:10:48.950
Are you okay?

00:10:48.950 --> 00:10:50.200
Yeah.

00:10:50.200 --> 00:10:51.830
Thank goodness.

00:10:55.500 --> 00:10:58.830
Excuse me...

00:10:58.830 --> 00:11:00.120
Did you do something?

00:11:00.120 --> 00:11:02.410
I... I didn't do anything.

00:11:02.410 --> 00:11:04.410
I hate violence.

00:11:04.410 --> 00:11:06.410
Harazy, let's go home.

00:11:06.410 --> 00:11:07.580
You must be hungry.

00:11:07.580 --> 00:11:09.330
Oh, that's right.

00:11:09.330 --> 00:11:12.160
Thank you for protecting Harazy.

00:11:13.950 --> 00:11:15.950
Thank you, Annie!

00:11:15.950 --> 00:11:17.160
Let's go home.

00:11:17.160 --> 00:11:18.660
Bye-bye!

00:11:20.000 --> 00:11:21.200
Bye-bye.

00:11:52.750 --> 00:11:55.330
Gravity Man is a humanoid monster?

00:11:55.330 --> 00:11:56.660
Seriously?!

00:12:01.040 --> 00:12:02.500
Annie...

00:12:13.370 --> 00:12:15.790
Annabella! Did you see the internet?

00:12:15.790 --> 00:12:21.330
It's terrible. Gravity Man
has become a murder suspect!

00:12:21.330 --> 00:12:26.500
There are rumors that Harazy isn't
his real daughter and she was kidnapped!

00:12:32.040 --> 00:12:34.410
I heard the corpse was a mess.

00:12:34.410 --> 00:12:36.750
They say Gravity Man did it?

00:12:36.750 --> 00:12:39.450
So, he was a dangerous man.

00:12:39.450 --> 00:12:41.620
He's already killed many people.

00:12:41.620 --> 00:12:44.290
Humanoid monster? What is that?

00:12:45.700 --> 00:12:47.450
The police came.

00:12:47.450 --> 00:12:51.580
The internet and city are in an uproar.

00:12:51.580 --> 00:12:53.950
I won't ask about the details.

00:12:53.950 --> 00:12:55.040
My apologies.

00:12:55.040 --> 00:12:57.750
Hide yourselves until things settle down.

00:12:57.750 --> 00:13:00.450
A parting gift.

00:13:00.450 --> 00:13:03.750
A ship is leaving the country at dawn.

00:13:03.750 --> 00:13:06.450
I'll have a talk with them.

00:13:06.450 --> 00:13:08.120
Leader...

00:13:08.120 --> 00:13:09.700
Bon voyage.

00:13:09.700 --> 00:13:11.250
We're getting on a boat?

00:13:11.250 --> 00:13:13.700
A relaxing vacation overseas.

00:13:13.700 --> 00:13:16.120
I'm jealous.

00:13:25.910 --> 00:13:29.040
Someone is spreading rumors.

00:13:29.040 --> 00:13:34.290
I don't think Gravity Man is a bad person.

00:13:34.290 --> 00:13:37.410
Everyone is being controlled by someone.

00:13:37.410 --> 00:13:39.620
That wasn't a trick.

00:13:41.290 --> 00:13:44.290
I feel no evil from that man.

00:13:44.290 --> 00:13:46.910
However, that power is dangerous.

00:13:46.910 --> 00:13:50.620
It is just too powerful.

00:13:50.620 --> 00:13:53.120
Will you leave this one to me?

00:13:53.120 --> 00:13:54.370
Bela?

00:14:00.700 --> 00:14:02.450
A vacation!

00:14:02.450 --> 00:14:05.580
Pack up your things, Harazy.

00:14:05.580 --> 00:14:07.750
I'm already done!

00:14:19.700 --> 00:14:20.790
Who is it?

00:14:23.200 --> 00:14:24.370
Harazy.

00:14:24.370 --> 00:14:25.950
Annie!

00:14:25.950 --> 00:14:27.120
What is it?

00:14:27.120 --> 00:14:28.950
There are rumors spreading.

00:14:28.950 --> 00:14:32.830
Gravity Man, star of the
illusion show, is a kidnapper.

00:14:32.830 --> 00:14:36.950
Every night, he goes and commits murder.

00:14:36.950 --> 00:14:38.500
I know.

00:14:38.500 --> 00:14:40.830
Kidnap? Murder?

00:14:40.830 --> 00:14:43.000
Hey, Val. What is that?

00:14:43.000 --> 00:14:45.950
Is that true? It's not, is it?

00:14:45.950 --> 00:14:47.830
A boat is leaving at dawn.

00:14:47.830 --> 00:14:50.250
You'll be caught before you make the dock.

00:14:50.250 --> 00:14:53.200
There are eyes all over town.

00:14:53.200 --> 00:14:55.040
I will take you two there.

00:14:55.040 --> 00:14:56.700
Don't get involved.

00:14:56.700 --> 00:15:00.040
The people of this city are all your enemies.

00:15:00.040 --> 00:15:01.450
We don't need help.

00:15:01.450 --> 00:15:03.250
The two of us have always done it alone.

00:15:03.250 --> 00:15:06.540
I know. But, believe in me.

00:15:06.540 --> 00:15:09.040
For her sake.

00:15:09.040 --> 00:15:11.370
I will believe in you.

00:15:15.790 --> 00:15:19.120
The explosion of the medical
facility in the military district.

00:15:19.120 --> 00:15:21.000
The cause is still under investigation.

00:15:21.000 --> 00:15:24.830
After the explosion, the patient Val Titan

00:15:24.830 --> 00:15:27.830
and an unknown girl went missing...

00:15:32.870 --> 00:15:35.250
The target has escaped.

00:15:35.250 --> 00:15:38.500
Within expectations. Continue the search.

00:15:38.500 --> 00:15:39.620
Yes!

00:15:41.790 --> 00:15:44.080
--Gravity Man is on the loose.
--He has a child with him.
--The destructive power
of Gravity Man is unnatural.

00:15:44.080 --> 00:15:46.330
--I want to see it.
--Where is he?
--The destructive power
of Gravity Man is unnatural.

00:15:50.330 --> 00:15:51.620
So stinky!

00:15:51.620 --> 00:15:54.540
Sorry. Just a bit longer.

00:15:54.540 --> 00:15:56.750
I'll try my best!

00:15:56.750 --> 00:15:58.870
Dawn is almost here.

00:15:58.870 --> 00:16:00.580
Ta-dah!

00:16:00.580 --> 00:16:02.160
What is that?

00:16:02.160 --> 00:16:05.910
That is Harazy's important friend.

00:16:05.910 --> 00:16:08.120
Let your big sister see it.

00:16:10.580 --> 00:16:12.160
All fixed.

00:16:12.160 --> 00:16:15.370
Wow! You're amazing, Annie!

00:16:15.370 --> 00:16:16.330
Here.

00:16:16.330 --> 00:16:18.080
Thank you!

00:16:22.830 --> 00:16:25.580
You aren't blood-related, are you?

00:16:25.580 --> 00:16:29.120
I met her at a military hospital.

00:16:29.120 --> 00:16:31.500
I was the head of a lunar expedition,

00:16:31.500 --> 00:16:36.040
but I was caught in an accident
outside and lost consciousness.

00:16:36.040 --> 00:16:40.040
I was found on the lunar surface and
before I realized it, 50 years had passed.

00:16:40.040 --> 00:16:42.330
They told me I was pulled into

00:16:42.330 --> 00:16:47.910
a gravitational singularity
and passed through space-time.

00:16:47.910 --> 00:16:52.620
I could no longer live
in the atmosphere on Earth.

00:16:52.620 --> 00:16:56.120
I am no longer human.

00:16:56.120 --> 00:16:58.200
On paper, I was deemed deceased.

00:16:58.200 --> 00:17:01.330
Every day, they experimented on me.

00:17:01.330 --> 00:17:04.830
One day, Harazy was brought in.

00:17:04.830 --> 00:17:09.660
By then, she was already called a witch.

00:17:09.660 --> 00:17:10.790
Witch?

00:17:10.790 --> 00:17:14.910
She is a good girl who is just
a bit more sensitive than others.

00:17:14.910 --> 00:17:21.290
However, they tried to
experiment on Harazy as well.

00:17:21.290 --> 00:17:24.290
Humans cornering other humans.

00:17:24.290 --> 00:17:26.370
I couldn't stand by and watch.

00:17:29.250 --> 00:17:31.500
So, I...

00:17:31.500 --> 00:17:33.000
...ran away.

00:17:40.370 --> 00:17:42.500
We've been together ever since.

00:17:42.500 --> 00:17:47.200
Harazy and I gravitated
to each other and became family.

00:17:47.200 --> 00:17:50.080
Hey, your power...

00:17:52.200 --> 00:17:53.750
What are you trying to say?

00:17:53.750 --> 00:17:56.750
You aimed a gun at me earlier.

00:17:56.750 --> 00:17:59.500
You'd be able to hurt me
easily with your powers.

00:18:01.540 --> 00:18:03.370
It's fine.

00:18:03.370 --> 00:18:06.540
I hope you find a place where
the two of you can live in peace.

00:18:19.950 --> 00:18:21.160
Harazy.

00:18:23.040 --> 00:18:25.330
Let her sleep.

00:18:25.330 --> 00:18:27.160
Annie...

00:18:27.160 --> 00:18:29.700
Could it be, that you...?

00:18:29.700 --> 00:18:32.120
No, impossible...

00:18:32.120 --> 00:18:35.830
That's right. I'm not human.

00:18:35.830 --> 00:18:37.000
I see.

00:18:37.000 --> 00:18:38.620
I'm kidding.

00:18:43.250 --> 00:18:45.790
Good-bye, Harazy.

00:18:57.120 --> 00:18:58.750
They were waiting?!

00:18:58.750 --> 00:19:00.830
We have captured the target.

00:19:00.830 --> 00:19:02.000
Don't let him escape.

00:19:02.000 --> 00:19:03.160
Yes!

00:19:03.160 --> 00:19:05.330
Surrender, Colonel Titan!

00:19:07.330 --> 00:19:09.870
Please, just this girl...

00:19:09.870 --> 00:19:13.200
Don't hit the girl. Capture her alive.

00:19:13.200 --> 00:19:14.330
Shoot!

00:19:21.660 --> 00:19:22.500
Stop!

00:19:22.500 --> 00:19:24.200
Do you plan to kill the suspect?

00:19:24.200 --> 00:19:25.700
Why?!

00:19:27.750 --> 00:19:29.000
Harazy...

00:19:36.410 --> 00:19:38.120
You are...!

00:19:38.120 --> 00:19:39.500
Beta?!

00:19:57.450 --> 00:19:59.410
Colonel Val Titan!

00:20:02.410 --> 00:20:03.750
Val?

00:20:08.700 --> 00:20:10.040
Val...

00:20:10.040 --> 00:20:13.700
Harazy. You are a kind and good girl.

00:20:13.700 --> 00:20:16.500
I wanted to stay with you forever.

00:20:16.500 --> 00:20:20.500
But I can't go with you anymore.

00:20:20.500 --> 00:20:22.660
Be good...

00:20:22.660 --> 00:20:25.950
No. I wanna be with Val.

00:20:25.950 --> 00:20:29.790
Val! Don't leave me alone!

00:20:29.790 --> 00:20:31.450
I'm sorry.

00:20:34.790 --> 00:20:36.200
Val?

00:20:36.200 --> 00:20:39.080
Val!

00:21:16.830 --> 00:21:19.160
Gravity Man was a fake.

00:21:19.160 --> 00:21:22.410
You were after Harazy from the beginning.

00:21:24.660 --> 00:21:27.410
Harazy was the one with powers.

00:21:27.410 --> 00:21:31.290
Val was protecting her powers
from being used by others.

00:21:31.290 --> 00:21:33.040
Unnecessary speculation.

00:21:33.040 --> 00:21:38.330
You manipulated information to control
the people of Libra City and corner Val.

00:21:38.330 --> 00:21:42.450
Then, you captured Harazy
after she used up her strength.

00:21:42.450 --> 00:21:45.450
You used some strong-handed methods.

